<title>UK: TENNIS-ZIMBABWE LEAD BRITAIN 2-1 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-ZIMBABWE LEAD BRITAIN 2-1 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zimbabwe lead Britain 2-1 in their Davis Cup Euro/African zone group one second round tie after victory in the doubles in Saturday.</p>
<p>Result:</p>
<p>Byron Black/Wayne Black (Zimbabwe) beat Mark Petchey/Neil Broad (Britain) 3-6 6-1 6-4 6-7 (6-8) 6-4</p>
</text>
